; A residual above half a unit at its commodity's display precision does
; not balance: 0.00000006 XAU at seven decimals is more than half of
; 0.0000001 XAU.  regress/balance-half-unit-residual.test pins the exact
; half, which balances.

commodity XAU
    format 1.0000000 XAU

2024/01/01 over half unit p7
    A    1.0000000 XAU
    B    -0.99999994 XAU

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 11:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 9-11:
> 2024/01/01 over half unit p7
>     A    1.0000000 XAU
>     B    -0.99999994 XAU
Unbalanced remainder is:
       0.0000001 XAU
Amount to balance against:
       1.0000000 XAU
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
